    "The New Way to Make Money with AI at Night (Even If You Have a 9-5)\nA practical playbook for finding an AI-enabled service, proving you can deliver it, and winning your first client without quitting your job\nHow to use this playbook\nThis playbook turns the supplied transcript into an actionable operating manual. Its central idea is straightforward: AI does not create a business merely by running in the background. A person still needs to choose a valuable outcome, direct the tools, judge the work, and build trust with customers. AI can compress research, production, prospecting preparation, writing, and website creation into the limited hours available outside a full-time job.",
