        "The transcript demonstrates using an AI agent (described there as a ChatGPT agent) to research potential opportunities while the user is away. The important transferable concept is not a particular character, interface, or product feature. It is a recurring research task with clear filters and a structured report.\n4.1 Define the research brief\nGive the agent:\n- Your available hours each week.\n- Your current skills and work experience.\n- Skills you are willing to learn.\n- Your preferred customer type or industries.\n- Your location or target market.\n- Your budget and tool constraints.\n- The kind of work you can perform outside business hours.\n- Your target time to a first customer.\nAsk it to investigate public evidence and return a shortlist rather than a huge unranked list.\n4.2 Adaptable prompt: nightly opportunity scan\nAct as a careful market-research assistant helping me choose a small AI-enabled service business that I can build outside a full-time job.",
