        "The transcript points toward a sales meeting but does not provide a complete call script. The following is a practical structure derived from the service workflow, not a verbatim source framework.\n12.1 Before the call\nReview:\n- The prospect's business and product.\n- The observation that prompted outreach.\n- The sample you prepared.\n- The scope you can genuinely deliver.\n- Questions that will reveal whether the problem matters.\n- Your minimum viable pilot and its boundaries.\n12.2 Suggested call structure\n1. Set the context.\n“Thanks for making time. I reached out because I noticed [specific observation]. I'd like to understand how you're handling [problem] today and see whether my service is relevant.”",
