        "Limits: do not guess email addresses, infer private information, send messages, or claim that a company has a budget without evidence.",
        "Escalation: mark uncertain cases for manual review rather than filling gaps with assumptions.\n14.4 Build in approval gates\nUse human approval before:\n- Sending outreach.\n- Replying to a client.\n- Publishing content.\n- Spending money.\n- Changing client systems.\n- Making a performance promise.\n- Sharing confidential files.\n- Deleting or overwriting data.\nAutomation should reduce repetitive preparation, not remove accountability."
